    "head_ref": "devin/1794124399-robustness-audit",
    "body": "[...] ate is cancelled.\n- `hand_off_payment` rejects an amount that differs from the approved total. The comparison is done in rounded cents.\n- If H errors after payment handoff, the existing payment handoff is kept and the user is told to check the booking. Before, another booking was offered, which could create a second order.\n- Watcher URLs whose origin contains a known contact value are dropped.\n- The unclear-answer fallback at final approval now names Confirmer/Annuler.\n\n**Phone client**\n- `AudioContext.resume()` now has a 10 s startup deadline.\n- Taps on detached or disabled approval buttons are ignored.\n- Option taps are latched until the server replies, so they are sent only once.\n- The socket now reconnects on bfcache `pageshow`.\n- Playback callbacks from a stale recorder are ignored.\n- Dynamically shown Oui/Non groups get the correct label and focus.\n- Rejections from earcon audio promises are now handled.\n\n**Desktop showcase**\n- Each `/watch` fetch and socket attempt has a 10 s deadline, followed by a retry.\n\n**Shuttle clone**\n- Two concurrent form posts now create only one order.\n- A failed Voilà callback now returns 503, so Stripe retries the webhook.\n\nNot verified: physical iOS/Android microphone and speech behaviour, and half-open radio loss.\n\nLink to Devin session: https://app.devin.ai/sessions/46f31849611a46c69f49987d5f25b701\nOpen in Devin Desktop: https://app.devin.ai/desktop/session/46f31849611a46c69f49987d5f25b701?variant=devin\nRequested by: @IvanMiao\n<!-- devin-review-badge-begin -->\n\n---\n\n🟢 Devin Review found nothing to fix · [View findings](https://app.devin.ai/review/wangunuxe/h-computer-hack/pull/37)\n\n<a href=\"https://app.devin.ai/review/wangunuxe/h-computer-hack/pull/37\" target=\"_blank\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://static.devin.ai/assets/gh-devin-review-dark.svg?v=4\"><img src=\"https://static.devin.ai/assets/gh-devin-review-light.svg?v=4\" alt=\"Devin Review\"></picture></a><!-- devin-review-badge-end -->",
